url: "https://github.com/amachino/haldane-gap-refinement"
abstract: >-
  A technical note autonomously researched and authored by GPT-6 Astra Max, an OpenAI AI
  agent, with exact rational verification of a conditional periodic spin-one
  Haldane-gap bound of 0.07 for every integer length at least 33,
  including odd lengths. A tighter polynomial filter and capped-moment
  comparison sharpen the spectral bounds and purity seeds using the same
  published finite data. The certificate covers ten finite intervals,
  one infinite tail, and the separate 0.06 bound at length 32, with 111
  exact checks. Earlier derivations and certificates are retained, with the original
  comparison's scope corrected. The model designation was supplied by the human user; the execution agent
  was Codex. A backend model snapshot identifier was not available. This work is unreviewed.
